The shared AI agent instructions for this repository live in `AGENTS.md` at the
repository root. Read and follow them.

Key rules — if you are an AI agent creating a commit, you are **disallowed** to:
- Push to the `main` branch without creating a Pull Request first.
- Cite yourself as a co-author (no `Co-Authored-By:` trailers or "Generated with"
  footers naming the AI agent).

Branches & PRs: reuse existing branches (check `git branch -a`), one branch per
feature, no stacked branches. Only open a PR towards `main` or a branch owned by
someone else — merge your own branches locally. No single-commit/draft PRs.

See `AGENTS.md` for the full instructions.
